ulator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids came in at 45% of normal. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 211% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 26882 had its driest year in 1963, at 62% of normal.</p>"}
